\description{
Compute bootstrap replicates of the site frequency spectra of
\code{\link[=pop_sfs]{pop_sfs()}}, \code{\link[=pairwise_pop_sfs]{pairwise_pop_sfs()}} and \code{\link[=nwise_pop_sfs]{nwise_pop_sfs()}}, by resampling
